node_modules/
.jshintrc
.eslintrc
.vscode/
.idea/
packs/*
!packs/skill-categories
# Foundry rewrites this LevelDB compendium every time it runs (new .ldb/.log/MANIFEST files, logs, lost/), which is
# data churn, not a change to the categories. The committed snapshot stays; to update it on purpose use `git add -f`.
packs/skill-categories/lost/
packs/skill-categories/LOCK
packs/skill-categories/LOG
packs/skill-categories/LOG.old
packs/skill-categories/*.ldb
packs/skill-categories/*.log
packs/skill-categories/MANIFEST-*
.cursorrules
docs/
coverage/
mcp-server/.env
.claude/settings.local.json